Knowledge sources (no code copied unless stated):
- OpenRakis/Cryogenic (Apache-2.0): reference emulator setup, driver behaviour,
  annotated disassembly doc/DNCDPRG.lst (from madmoose/dune-chani).
- oplon (MIT, https://codeberg.org/sbechet/oplon): OPL2/OPL3 FM synthesis,
  used as a dependency.
- miniz_oxide (MIT/Apache-2.0/Zlib): snapshot compression, used as a dependency.
- SingleStepTests/80286 (MIT): hardware test vectors used to validate the CPU;
  downloaded at test time, not redistributed.

Picture filter shaders (web/src/render/shaders), ported to GLSL ES 3.00:
- mmpx.frag: MMPX by Morgan McGuire and Mara Gagiu
  (https://casual-effects.com/research/McGuire2021PixelArt/), MIT License,
  from hunterk's GLSL adaptation in libretro/glsl-shaders.
- xbr-lv2.frag: xBR-lv2, Copyright (C) 2011-2016 Hyllian, MIT License (full
  text in the file).
- crt-lottes.frag: CRT shader by Timothy Lottes, public domain.
- output.frag: the sharp-bilinear method follows Themaister's public-domain
  shader (own implementation).
- scale2x.frag: own implementation of the Scale2x/EPX rules (Andrea Mazzoleni).

